sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant App_Admin as "CollabTask App (Admin)"
    participant Server
    participant Notification_Service as "Notification Service"
    participant App_User as "CollabTask App (User)"
    actor User

    title Use Case 6: Admin Requests Revisions

    Admin ->> App_Admin: 1. Clicks 'Request Revisions' (adds comment)
    App_Admin ->> Server: 2. PUT /api/tasks/{id} (status: 'InProgress', comment: '...')
    
    activate Server
    Server ->> Server: 3. Update status & save comment
    Server -->> App_Admin: 4. Response: {OK}
    deactivate Server
    
    %% Notify User
    Server ->> Notification_Service: 5. Trigger notifyUser(userId, taskId, "revision")
    
    activate Notification_Service
    Notification_Service ->> App_User: 6. Push Notification ("Revisions needed")
    deactivate Notification_Service
    
    App_User ->> User: 7. Show notification
    
    %% Real-time update
    Server ->> App_User: 8. (WebSocket) 'TASK_UPDATED' (status: 'InProgress')
    App_User ->> User: 9. Update UI (Task moves back to 'In Progress')